From 1bc5e47202ee5cccc1991e1507b08f27eb6bdbc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Travis Cole <11240+kelp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:52:12 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] integration: fit the branches to upstream fcc64611's
 refactors

Upstream moved UI strings to tr() and N_(), click handlers to event_t *,
rows to widget_t *, and some test stubs to jump(). The merged branches'
own files follow suit here, card_away stops More Like This's request,
OPRA's screens and Hi-Res's row sit where the merges put them, and the
changelog's branch lines go under 1.9.3. rerere replays only conflict
hunks, so these edits outside them are kept as this fixup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DaXZzN3FY6RrXiA6e34J2b
